(51, 'AF-500 FRP Sloped-Lid Waste Bin', 'outdoor', 'Municipal street furniture', 'Weatherproof', NULL, 'One-piece glass-fiber reinforced waste bin with a self-closing sloped lid — rain runs off, waste stays hidden, graffiti cleans off. Deployed in parks, promenades and transit plazas.', '{"Model":"AF-500","Type":"Sloped-lid outdoor waste bin","Material":"Fiberglass reinforced composite (FRP/SMC)","Finish":"UV-stable gelcoat, custom RAL colors","Features":"Rust-proof, waterproof lid, lift-out inner liner","Mounting":"Free-standing or bolt-down","Customization":"Embossed / printed logo"}'::jsonb, 'assets/images/products/outdoor/af-500-bin.jpg', '[]'::jsonb, true, 51, '2026-08-31T00:00:00'),
